# Send a batch of discrete move commands to the STM32 and run them as
# one queued sequence (matches the firmware's own batching: N move
# packets + a '#' trigger packet, executed back-to-back on the STM32
# before it replies). Blocks until the STM32 replies FIN/BUS/FUL or the
# bridge's timeout elapses -- the firmware gives no progress signal
# during execution, so there's nothing meaningful to report mid-call.
MoveCommand[] commands
---
bool success
string status
